-- Altadena Library District (by trustee area, 6 seats; RR/CC DST LIB AL; https://www.altadenalibrary.org/board):
--   Trustee (Trustee Area 1): Boon Lim -- appointed 2024-12-01 (month)
--   Trustee (Trustee Area 2): Kameelah Waheed Wilkerson -- elected 2024-12-01 (month)
--   Trustee (Trustee Area 3): VACANT -- Trustee Area 3 is first filled by the Nov 3 2026 election (district notice: "NOTICE OF ELECTION FOR NOVEMBER 3, 2026 FOR TRUSTEE AREAS 3 AND 4"); until then the seat is held at large (Mahramas).
