--   Trustee (At-Large): Justin Mahramas -- appointed 2025-04-28 (day)
--   Trustee (At-Large): Ray Ruffin -- appointed 2025-01-27 (day)
-- Palos Verdes Library District (at large, 5 seats; RR/CC DST LIB PV; https://www.pvld.org/about/trustees):
--   Trustee: Jonathan Beutler -- appointed 2022-12-01 (month)
--   Trustee: Rosa Kwon Easton -- appointed 2022-12-01 (month)
